msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "I found one, Hana-chan!"
msgstr "¡Encontré a uno, Hana-chan!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Hana"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "See this girl? Her name's Hana-chan. What do you think of\\r\nher?"
msgstr "¿Ves a esta chica? Se llama Hana-chan. ¿Qué opinas de\\r\nella?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Scout"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "¿A qué te refieres?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "I mean, what do you think of her as a woman?"
msgstr "Quiero decir, ¿cuál es tu opinión de ella como mujer?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Scout"
msgid "Who, me?"
msgstr "... ¿Yo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "Yes, you."
msgstr "Sí, tú."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Scout"
msgid "But I can't just say something like that right in front of her! I'm way too shy!"
msgstr "¡Pero no puedo decir algo así frente a ella! ¡Soy demasiado tímido!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm begging you. Just say it..."
msgstr "Te lo ruego. Solo dilo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Scout"
msgid "Well, if you insist..."
msgstr "Está bien, si insistes..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Scout"
msgid "I think she's amazing..."
msgstr "Me parece fabulosa..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Akiyama"
msgid "What's that? Louder!"
msgstr "¿Qué estás diciendo? ¡Habla más fuerte!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Scout"
msgid "I think she's amazing. She's totally my type."
msgstr "Me parece fabulosa. Es totalmente mi tipo de mujer."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Akiyama"
msgid "You hear that, Hana-chan?"
msgstr "¿Oíste eso, Hana-chan?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Hana"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Akiyama"
msgid "See, you don't have to go on a diet to be attractive."
msgstr "¿Ves? No necesitas estar a dieta para ser atractiva."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Akiyama"
msgid "Isn't that right?"
msgstr "¿No es cierto?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Scout"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr "Absolutamente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Akiyama"
msgid "What do you say, Hana-chan? Do you believe me now?"
msgstr "¿Qué dices, Hana-chan? ¿Ahora sí me crees?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Hana"
msgid "Please leave."
msgstr "Por favor vete."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Scout"
msgid "Huh? Me?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Yo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "Aw, c'mon, Hana-chan! What now? You told me to bring him\\r\nhere!"
msgstr "¡Ah, por dios, Hana-chan! ¿Qué pasó ahora? ¡Tú misma me pediste que te lo trajera\\r\naquí!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Hana"
msgid "Just get him out of here, will you!?"
msgstr "Simplemente, sácalo de aquí, ¡¿quieres!?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Akiyama"
msgid "All right, all right. Sorry for dragging you into this."
msgstr "Está bien, está bien. Lo siento por arrastrarte a esto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Scout"
msgid "Oh, uh, that's okay... Was it something I said?"
msgstr "Oh, Uh, Está bien... ¿Fue por algo que dije?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Akiyama"
msgid "You never can tell when it comes to women like her..."
msgstr "Nunca se sabe en cuanto a mujeres como ella..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Akiyama"
msgid "Hana-chan...? You all right?"
msgstr "¿Hana-chan...? ¿Estás bien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Hana"
msgid "Why did you have to bring that man here?"
msgstr "¿Por qué tuviste que traer a ese hombre aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Akiyama"
msgid "What!? But you told me to!"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?! ¡Pero si tu me lo pediste!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Hana"
msgid "Honestly, Chief. You're as clueless about women as ever..."
msgstr "Siendo honesta, Jefe. Has sido igual de despistado con las mujeres como siempre..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Akiyama"
msgid "Hana-chan..."
msgstr "Hana-chan..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "500_Hana"
msgid "Sometimes I just feel like losing weight."
msgstr "A veces tengo ganas de perder peso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "512_Hana"
msgid "Some girls up and cut their bangs. Others suddenly go on an\\r\nall-apple diet. It's just what girls do!"
msgstr "Algunas chicas se levantan de la cama y se cortan el flequillo. Otras de repente hacen\\r\nuna de solo manzanas de la nada. ¡Son cosas que hacemos las chicas!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "524_Akiyama"
msgid "And that's what this diet is all about?"
msgstr "¿Así que de eso se trataba?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "536_Hana"
msgid "I was reading a magazine, okay!? A fashion magazine."
msgstr "Leía una revista, ¡¿de acuerdo?! Una revista de moda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "548_Akiyama"
msgid "A fashion magazine? That's not like you."
msgstr "¿Una revista de moda? Eso no es muy tú que digamos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "560_Hana"
msgid "It said that the slim look is in this spring. So I got to\\r\nthinking about how nice it would be to wear something in\\r\nstyle for once..."
msgstr "Decía que versé delgada estaría de moda esta primavera. Así que me\\r\npuse a pensar lo bonito que sería vestir algo con\\r\nestilo alguna vez..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "572_Akiyama"
msgid "Hana-chan..."
msgstr "Hana-chan..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "584_Hana"
msgid "But no! Forget about it! No more diets!"
msgstr "¡Pero no! ¡Olvídalo! ¡No más dietas!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "596_Akiyama"
msgid "Whoa, hang on a second, Hana-chan! No need to call the whole\\r\nthing off!"
msgstr "Vaya, ¡espera un segundo, Hana-chan! ¡No hay necesidad de cancelar \\r\nla dieta!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "608_Hana"
msgid "Just leave me alone! I realized something while I was\\r\nwaiting for you..."
msgstr "¡Solo déjame sola! Me di cuenta de algo\\r\nmientras te esperaba..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "620_Hana"
msgid "One whiff of that deluxe kalbi, and I just can't help\\r\nmyself!"
msgstr "Con solo oler ese kalbi de lujo, ¡no pude\\r\naguantar las ganas!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "644_Akiyama"
msgid "Yow!"
msgstr "¡Auch!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "656_Hana"
msgid "It was simply divine! Meat is such a crucial part of any\\r\nmeal, don't you think?"
msgstr "¡Estaba divino! La carne es esencial en\\r\ncualquier comida, ¿no lo crees?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "668_Akiyama"
msgid "You ate both of them?"
msgstr "¿Te comiste ambos?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "680_Hana"
msgid "I'll let it slide for today. I mean, you did work pretty\\r\nhard out there for me."
msgstr "Dejaré pasar todo lo de hoy, Quiero decir, trabajaste bastante\\r\nduro ahí fuera por mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "692_Akiyama"
msgid "I don't know whether to laugh or cry..."
msgstr "No sé si reír o llorar..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "704_Hana"
msgid "Say, are you sure you just want to leave that nice man\\r\nhanging like that? He did come all this way. You should\\r\nat least say thank you."
msgstr "Dime, ¿de verdad quieres dejar a ese buen hombre\\r\nesperándote así? Vino hasta aquí. Por lo menos\\r\ndeberías darle las gracias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "716_Akiyama"
msgid "Right, of course. I'll be right back."
msgstr "Sí, es cierto. Ya vuelvo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "728_Hana"
msgid "Okay. See you later."
msgstr "Está bien. Nos vemos luego."

